      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Botines%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Botines lies within the South Texas Plains, a landscape of thorny brushlands and grasslands that historically supported ranching.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/botines_texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Botines is classified as a town but lacks its own incorporation and does not have a post office.",
